  "historyNote": "#7751, eff 8-17-02, EXPIRED: 8-17-10 New. #9786, INTERIM, eff 9-20-10; ss and renumbered by #9888-A, eff 3-19-11, EXPIRED: 3-19-19 (formerly He-E 802.18) New. #12741, INTERIM, eff 3-20-19, EXPIRED: 9-16-19 New. #13130, eff 10-30-20",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
